message: "If you use CorrPrior, please cite this software repository. Paper metadata will be added when available."
type: software
title: "CorrPrior: Correction-Supervised Spatial Prior for Real-World Image Super-Resolution"
authors:
  - family-names: Le
    given-names: Hoai Nam
  - family-names: Nguyen
    given-names: Hoang Ha
repository-code: "https://github.com/namle24/CorrPrior"
abstract: "CorrPrior learns a spatial prior from paired degraded and clean images using reconstruction and correction supervision, then transfers the frozen encoder features to a super-resolution network."
keywords:
  - image super-resolution
  - image restoration
  - spatial prior
  - representation learning
